"type":16,"army":1,"x":32,"y":25},{"type":1,"army":1,"x":36,"y":25},{"type":51,"army":1,"x":36,"y":30}],"arrivals":[{"turn":4,"army":0,"units":[{"type":39,"x":11,"y":26},{"type":39,"x":11,"y":28}]}],"objective":{"kind":"command"},"general":{"x":1,"y":13},"turnLimit":24,"cap":16,"music":14,"briefing":"F6 Luggnagg, the Foundry that builds half the Union's warships. Its workers have not been paid since Babylon fell. They have been told to work faster.\n\nFour walled works stand on the station, each with a dock and its own guns. The two in the east hold the Cortex command centres that run the whole Foundry: destroy both and Luggnagg is ours.\n\nThe southwest works has already stopped answering the Union. Its dock stands grey: take it and what it holds. The workers say more of their crews will cut their cruisers loose and come over to us once the fighting starts.\n\nThe plasma river cuts the station in two. Gravity flux rings the works: mecha cannot cross it, railguns lose half their bite against anything sheltering in it. Use the gaps. A minefield closes the east lane, and a carrier group waits behind it.","goal":"Destroy both Cortex command centres in the eastern works.","guards":2}